msgid "### 5.3 Troubleshooting {: #installation-troubleshooting }"
msgstr "### 5.3 Troubleshooting {: #installation-troubleshooting }"

msgid "#### 5.3.1 `npu-smi` Works, but Python Cannot Detect the NPU"
msgstr "#### 5.3.1 `npu-smi` 正常，但 Python 看不到 NPU"

msgid "Also confirm that you have loaded the environment:"
msgstr "同时确认："

msgid "#### 5.3.2 `libatb.so` Cannot Be Found"
msgstr "#### 5.3.2 `libatb.so` 找不到"

msgid ""
"This usually means that the NNAL environment is not installed or has not "
"been loaded."
msgstr "通常表示 NNAL 环境未安装或未加载。"

msgid "Then load it:"
msgstr "并加载："

msgid "#### 5.3.3 The Device Is Not Visible in Docker"
msgstr "#### 5.3.3 Docker 中看不到设备"

msgid "First, check the host:"
msgstr "先确认 Host："

msgid "Then verify that:"
msgstr "然后检查："

msgid ""
"- `docker run --device` passes the correct device nodes;\n"
"- the required driver libraries are mounted;\n"
"- Atlas A3 uses the complete dual-DIE device pair;\n"
"- Atlas 200I Pro uses the additional product-specific devices and mounts."
msgstr ""
"- `docker run --device` 是否传入了正确 device node；\n"
"- 是否挂载了需要的 driver libraries；\n"
"- Atlas A3 是否使用了完整的 dual-DIE device pair；\n"
"- Atlas 200I Pro 是否使用了产品专用的额外 device/mount。"

msgid "#### 5.3.4 `docker pull` Fails"
msgstr "#### 5.3.4 `docker pull` 失败"

msgid ""
"The Docker daemon and the current shell use separate network configurations."
msgstr "Docker daemon 与当前 shell 使用不同的网络配置。"

msgid "Check the following first:"
msgstr "优先检查："

msgid ""
"- daemon proxy;\n"
"- registry mirror;\n"
"- DNS;\n"
"- organization network policy."
msgstr ""
"- daemon proxy；\n"
"- registry mirror；\n"
"- DNS；\n"
"- 组织网络策略。"

msgid "#### 5.3.5 Device Type Mismatch After pip / Wheel Installation"
msgstr "#### 5.3.5 pip / wheel 安装后 device type 不匹配"

msgid "Check:"
msgstr "检查："

msgid "If the wheel does not match the target hardware:"
msgstr "如果 wheel 与目标硬件不匹配："

msgid ""
"- switch to WheelNext;\n"
"- use a pre-built image for the hardware;\n"
"- or build from source for the target hardware."
msgstr ""
"- 改用 WheelNext；\n"
"- 使用预构建硬件镜像；\n"
"- 或从源码为目标硬件构建。"

msgid "#### 5.3.6 `pip check` Reports Dependency Conflicts"
msgstr "#### 5.3.6 `pip check` 报告依赖冲突"

msgid "First distinguish between:"
msgstr "先区分："

msgid ""
"- core software conflicts;\n"
"- optional feature dependencies;\n"
"- known metadata conflicts in the current release."
msgstr ""
"- 核心软件冲突；\n"
"- 可选 feature dependency；\n"
"- 当前 release 已知 metadata conflict。"

msgid ""
"Do not ignore additional conflicts involving any of the following "
"components:"
msgstr "任何涉及以下组件的额外冲突都不应直接忽略："

msgid "To avoid wheel metadata issues, use a pre-built image."
msgstr "如果希望避免 wheel metadata 问题，优先使用预构建镜像。"

msgid "#### 5.3.7 ModelScope Download Compatibility Issues"
msgstr "#### 5.3.7 ModelScope 下载兼容问题"

msgid "If Hugging Face is inaccessible, you can use:"
msgstr "如果 Hugging Face 不可访问，可以使用："

msgid ""
"ModelScope 1.38 and later releases changed Hub behavior, the cache layout, "
"and repository metadata, which may cause older vLLM model-ID integrations to"
" fail."
msgstr ""
"ModelScope 1.38 及以上版本的 Hub 行为、cache layout 和 repository metadata\n"
"发生变化，旧版 vLLM model-ID integration 可能因此失败。"

msgid ""
"If you need to use a newer version, explicitly download the model first:"
msgstr "需要使用新版本时，建议先显式下载："

msgid "Then replace the model ID in the Quickstart with:"
msgstr "然后在 Quickstart 中把 model ID 替换为："

msgid ""
"#### 5.3.8 Installation Verification Passes, but the Model Fails to Run"
msgstr "#### 5.3.8 Installation verification 通过，但模型运行失败"

msgid "If the following checks pass:"
msgstr "如果下面条件已经通过："

msgid ""
"- NPU tensor operation;\n"
"- vLLM Ascend plugin registration;\n"
"- core package check;"
msgstr ""
"- NPU tensor operation；\n"
"- vLLM Ascend plugin registration；\n"
"- core package check；"

msgid "then troubleshoot the failure at the model layer:"
msgstr "那么模型失败通常应转到模型层排查："

msgid ""
"- whether the model supports the target hardware;\n"
"- dtype/quantization;\n"
"- TP/DP/EP;\n"
"- graph parameters;\n"
"- device memory;\n"
"- model weights and tokenizer."
msgstr ""
"- 模型是否支持目标硬件；\n"
"- dtype/quantization；\n"
"- TP/DP/EP；\n"
"- graph 参数；\n"
"- 显存；\n"
"- 模型权重和 tokenizer。"

msgid "Continue with:"
msgstr "此时继续查看："

msgid ""
"- [Quickstart](quick_start.md)\n"
"- [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)\n"
"- [Model Tutorials](../tutorials/models/index.md)\n"
"- [FAQs](../faqs.md)"
msgstr ""
"- [Quickstart](quick_start.md)\n"
"- [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)\n"
"- [Model Tutorials](../tutorials/models/index.md)\n"
"- [FAQs](../faqs.md)"

msgid "Confirm:"
msgstr "确认："
